@startuml 捕获界面状态图
' 冉昕霖 · 第二阶段分析 · 捕获界面状态图
' 描述 CapturePage 的界面状态，不是服务端 Challenge 的业务状态
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  BorderColor #6F97B8
  FontColor #1F2A37
  ArrowColor #5B6B7C
}

state "加载中\nLOADING" as Loading
state "待作答\nREADY" as Ready
state "提交中\nSUBMITTING" as Submitting
state "结果待确认\nUNKNOWN" as Unknown
state "已捕获\nCAPTURED" as Captured
state "已过期\nEXPIRED" as Expired
state "加载失败\nLOAD_FAILED" as LoadFailed

[*] --> Loading : 进入答题页

Loading : entry / 调用 challenge(spawnId)
Loading --> Ready : 题目就绪 / 保存 challengeId 与有效期
Loading --> LoadFailed : 取题失败 / 显示原因与重试
LoadFailed --> Loading : 点击重试

Ready : entry / 恢复选项可点击、清空旧错误
Ready --> Submitting : 选择选项 / 生成新 requestId、禁用按钮
Ready --> Captured : 查询发现已捕获 / 不重复发奖
Ready --> Expired : 收到 41001 / 提示重新遭遇

Submitting : entry / 禁用返回与重复点击
Submitting --> Captured : result=CORRECT 且 captureRecordId 非空
Submitting --> Ready : result=WRONG / 记录答错，允许新作答
Submitting --> Unknown : 超时或连接中断 / 禁止自行判定成功

Unknown : entry / 显示「结果待确认」
Unknown --> Captured : 查询 status=CAPTURED
Unknown --> Submitting : 查询 status=OPEN 且上次内容已知\n用原 requestId 重试
Unknown --> Ready : 查询 status=OPEN 且内容不可恢复\n按新作答处理
Unknown --> Expired : 查询 status=EXPIRED
Unknown --> Unknown : 查询仍失败 / 保留原 requestId 供重试

Captured : entry / 刷新收藏概览
Captured --> [*] : 返回地图

Expired --> [*] : 返回地图并提示重新遭遇

note right of Unknown
  超时不等于失败，也不等于成功。
  只有服务端结算结果才能离开本状态。
end note

note bottom of Submitting
  同一 requestId 只对应一次业务提交；
  用户重新作答必须生成新 requestId。
end note
@enduml
